VortX bounded owned subtitle constructor and checked conversion/filter completion.

Base: mpv 8c67647b50059406c5c0444903597281b81516cf, after retained platform,
HTTP/audio/GPU, original-local-file witness and edition-title lifetime patches.
All eight constructor preimages equal that exact upstream commit. Only these
subtitle files are carried; unrelated custom native work is excluded.

Includes the four-line owned filter-cache root-mask correction: changing a
filter group must retain its declared UPDATE_SUB_FILT root mask before native
filter reset and whole-corpus re-decode. Ordinary decoder entry points retain
their existing behavior. A complete native rebuild is required after the
sd_functions layout addition; old objects must never substitute for that rebuild.

This source carrier is not a platform SDK, renderer/host integration, installed
feature, device or release acceptance. The bounded 74-assertion native fixture
passes with its intentional incomplete-gate exit2; open fault/bitmap/sanitizer
and consumer lifetime gates remain separate. Existing upstream licensing applies.

